Rebase-Notes (llvmorg-20.1.8 -> llvmorg-21.1.8):
  - clang/lib/AST/Expr.cpp: dropped hunk (llvm/llvm-project#130272 CallExpr::getBeginLoc assertion fixed upstream in LLVM 21).
